+*   **Input:** A 3D coordinate $\mathbf{x} \in \mathbb{R}^3$ and a viewing direction $\mathbf{d} \in \mathbb{R}^2$ (encoded as spherical harmonics or similar).
+*   **Output:** Volume density $\sigma \in \mathbb{R}$ and color $\mathbf{c} \in \mathbb{R}^3$.
 
